        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Rh4psody\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/c4cdca/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rh4psody:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Jeysie wrote:</b><br><blockquote>I'm still getting a File Not Found error...\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nIs anybody else still having difficulty downloading? Jeysie, are you using Excel?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's not Excel that's the issue, it's that I keep getting a \"the requested page could not be found\" issue when trying to view the attachment. Guess I'm the only one having trouble, though… <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
