        "created_at": "2016-11-19T00:14:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Rh4psody wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Jeysie wrote:<br><blockquote>I'm still getting a File Not Found error...&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nIs anybody else still having difficulty downloading? Jeysie, are you using Excel?\n</blockquote></div>\nIt's not Excel that's the issue, it's that I keep getting a \"the requested page could not be found\" issue when trying to view the attachment. Guess I'm the only one having trouble, though... :/\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I was having the issue too, but just now I was able to download it. The issue is not with the file itself, but with a forum bug where a post's edit is not visible to several people, even if others can see it. The edited post now shows it was last edited two hours ago.</p>",
