        "cooked": "<p>OK, I'm going to do another chunk:</p><ul>\n<li>The Naturalist</li>\n<li>La Capitan (Villain Team)</li>\n<li>Citizens Hammer &amp; Anvil (Villain Team)</li>\n<li>Ermine (Villain Team)</li>\n<li>Friction (Villain Team)</li>\n</ul><p>I'll just use my previous copy of the file as I can't currently get the one from the OP either, as it seems to have reverted back for me.&nbsp; We should probably just make new posts each time we want to post a new version of the file.</p>",
